CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     HHoossttaapp mode is not directly supported by the device; it is implemented
     through IBSS mode (as a result, DFS/passive channels are not available in
     this mode).

     Powersave may be unstable on some networks (results in occasional ''wwppii%%dd::
     ddeevviiccee ttiimmeeoouutt'' messages); you can try to disable it to improve device
     stability.

